# Tamagi — the basics offered at first login (the window and tamagi-firstrun).
# Like openSUSE Aeon: a short list, ticked or not, and nothing else. Everything
# in the catalog stays available later with `tamagi install`.
#   <on|off> <id>      id: a catalog.tsv id, or the app id of a Flatpak in
#                      flatpaks.list ("opcional"). on = ticked by default.
# Shown in this order, grouped by the category of each item. The browser is
# asked on its own page (Opera GX, Chrome, Chromium, Vivaldi) and cannot be
# listed here.
on  dev.edfloreshz.Calculator
on  dev.edfloreshz.CosmicTweaks
off io.github.cosmic_utils.Examine
off dev.edfloreshz.Tasks
off com.jwestall.Forecast
off io.github.flattool.Ignition
off io.missioncenter.MissionCenter
off org.onlyoffice.desktopeditors
off whatsapp
